The primary objective is to ensure that every module is correctly wired to the existing frontend, backend, APIs, database, telemetry collectors, event pipelines, and real-time update mechanisms where applicable.

Verify that all displayed assets, TLS connections, certificates, encryption configurations, protocol statistics, trust relationships, security findings, orchestration tasks, and operational statuses accurately reflect the user's actual authorized environment and verified system data.

